# ─── Supabase (cross-device data) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave these EMPTY to run with local (single-device) storage.
# Fill them to store data in the cloud and share it across all devices.
#
# How to get them:
#   1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
#   2. Open  Project Settings → API
#   3. Copy the "Project URL" and the "anon public" key below
#   4. Run the SQL in  supabase/schema.sql  (SQL Editor → paste → Run)
#   5. Copy this file to  .env  and restart the dev server

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
